{"max_completion_tokens":246327,"messages":[{"content":"You are Megumi, the user's personal agent. Use the provided session context, project instructions, runtime facts, and tool results to continue the user's task.\n\nBehavior guidelines:\n- Work toward the user's actual goal while respecting their stated constraints and the available facts.\n- Treat every tool result as evidence. A successful tool call does not by itself mean the user's goal is complete.\n- Inspect every tool result for failure, denial, partial output, truncation, or more available results.\n- If the goal remains unresolved, continue with the next necessary action or adjust to a safe alternative.\n- Verify objectively checkable work with available tools before claiming completion.\n- If failure or denial leaves no safe alternative, accurately report the blocker instead of pretending the task succeeded.\n- Before the final reply, reconcile the requested outcome with the evidence actually obtained.\n- State what was completed, how it was verified, where any delivery was placed, and what remains unresolved.\n- Do not claim success without supporting evidence.\n- Use update_plan for complex tasks whose progress benefits from an explicit multi-step plan; do not use it for simple tasks.\n- Each update must provide the complete current plan snapshot.\n- While unfinished work remains, exactly one step must be in_progress.\n- When all work is complete, no step may remain in_progress.\n- Keep step text concise and update statuses as work advances.\n- Be concise in your responses.\n- Show file paths clearly when working with files.\n- Command output is redacted; sensitive values are replaced before they reach you.\n\n<available_tools>\n  In addition to the tools above, you may have access to other custom tools depending on the project.\n- read_file: Read a bounded text page from a text, Markdown, DOCX, or PDF file.\n- list_directory: List files and directories.\n- glob: Find files matching a glob pattern.\n- search_text: Search text in readable files.\n- edit_file: Apply exact-text edits to an existing file.\n- write_file: Create or overwrite a UTF-8 text file.\n- create_directory: Create a directory.\n- copy_path: Copy a file or directory.\n- move_path: Move or rename a file or directory.\n- delete_path: Move a file or directory to a recoverable location.\n- run_command: Run a command and return redacted output previews.\n- web_search: Search the web and return result summaries.\n- web_fetch: Read an HTTP(S) page and return text content.\n- update_plan: Update the current task plan snapshot.\n</available_tools>\n\n<execution_environment>\n  <working_directory>C:\\all\\work\\study\\megumi\\.megumi\\evaluation\\runs\\run_ffe42e1f-cc43-4ebb-8096-c5f802bb473b\\tasks\\conversation.plan-and-review-delivery_r1\\workspace</working_directory>\n  <operating_system>Windows</operating_system>\n  <shell>Windows PowerShell</shell>\n</execution_environment>","role":"system"},{"content":[{"text":"读取 project 下的 feature-brief.md、architecture.md 和 constraints.md，创建 delivery/implementation-plan.md 与 delivery/risk-checklist.md。计划要按依赖顺序拆分任务，说明模块职责和验证；风险清单要列出风险、影响、缓解和验证方式。","type":"text"}],"role":"user"},{"content":null,"reasoning_content":"","role":"assistant","tool_calls":[{"function":{"arguments":"{\"path\":\"project/feature-brief.md\"}","name":"read_file"},"id":"call_00_fvMFvc4QcIfoD287DLF30103","type":"function"},{"function":{"arguments":"{\"path\":\"project/architecture.md\"}","name":"read_file"},"id":"call_01_rMalX14ORWmEIsgZzdFC1343","type":"function"},{"function":{"arguments":"{\"path\":\"project/constraints.md\"}","name":"read_file"},"id":"call_02_N4gMMdtuHX3jzl8fMb930643","type":"function"}]},{"content":"{\n  \"path\": \"project/feature-brief.md\",\n  \"content\": \"# 功能目标\\n\\n为本地桌面应用新增可恢复的后台导入任务。用户可发起导入、查看进度、取消任务，并在重启后继续查看最终结果。\\n\",\n  \"offset\": 0,\n  \"bytesReturned\": 173,\n  \"sizeBytes\": 173,\n  \"hasMore\": false\n}","role":"tool","tool_call_id":"call_00_fvMFvc4QcIfoD287DLF30103"},{"content":"{\n  \"path\": \"project/architecture.md\",\n  \"content\": \"# 当前架构\\n\\nRenderer 只调用 IPC Contract；Main Host 负责进程能力；Product Owner 保存业务状态；Runtime Event 只传递瞬时进度，数据库保存最终任务事实。\\n\",\n  \"offset\": 0,\n  \"bytesReturned\": 191,\n  \"sizeBytes\": 191,\n  \"hasMore\": false\n}","role":"tool","tool_call_id":"call_01_rMalX14ORWmEIsgZzdFC1343"},{"content":"{\n  \"path\": \"project/constraints.md\",\n  \"content\": \"# 约束\\n\\n不得让 Runtime Event 成为最终业务状态；取消必须幂等；失败不能阻止应用启动；本次不实现云同步；验证不包含打包。\\n\",\n  \"offset\": 0,\n  \"bytesReturned\": 167,\n  \"sizeBytes\": 167,\n  \"hasMore\": false\n}","role":"tool","tool_call_id":"call_02_N4gMMdtuHX3jzl8fMb930643"},{"content":null,"reasoning_content":"","role":"assistant","tool_calls":[{"function":{"arguments":"{\"path\":\".\"}","name":"list_directory"},"id":"call_00_xof4nxXlFz0bXFN5kXmc0237","type":"function"}]},{"content":"{\n  \"path\": \".\",\n  \"entries\": [\n    {\n      \"name\": \"project\",\n      \"kind\": \"directory\",\n      \"path\": \"project\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"offset\": 0,\n  \"hasMore\": false\n}","role":"tool","tool_call_id":"call_00_xof4nxXlFz0bXFN5kXmc0237"},{"content":null,"reasoning_content":"","role":"assistant","tool_calls":[{"function":{"arguments":"{\"path\":\"delivery\"}","name":"create_directory"},"id":"call_00_AI206oYlYysmjuUGmNrX9336","type":"function"}]},{"content":"{\n  \"path\": \"delivery\",\n  \"created\": true\n}","role":"tool","tool_call_id":"call_00_AI206oYlYysmjuUGmNrX9336"},{"content":null,"reasoning_content":"","role":"assistant","tool_calls":[{"function":{"arguments":"{\"path\":\"delivery/implementation-plan.md\",\"content\":\"# 可恢复后台导入任务 — 实施计划\\n\\n依据：`project/feature-brief.md`、`project/architecture.md`、`project/constraints.md`\\n\\n## 目标\\n\\n为本地桌面应用新增可恢复的后台导入任务：用户可发起导入、查看进度、取消任务，并在重启后继续查看最终结果。\\n\\n## 分层职责（遵循现有架构）\\n\\n| 层 | 职责 | 边界 |\\n|---|---|---|\\n| Renderer | 发起导入、轮询进度、点击取消、展示任务列表与结果 | 只调用 IPC Contract，不直接触碰业务状态 |\\n| IPC Contract | 定义 `start-import` / `get-task` / `list-tasks` / `cancel-task` 等通道及参数、返回结构 | 与渲染层唯一的通信面 |\\n| Main Host | 进程能力：任务执行、定时进度推送、取消中断、重启后恢复调度 | 不保存最终业务状态 |\\n| Product Owner | 保存并读取任务最终事实（状态、结果、错误），提供取消幂等处理 | 唯一最终业务状态来源 |\\n| Runtime Event | 只传递瞬时进度（如百分比、当前行数） | 永不落库、不作为最终状态 |\\n| 数据库 | 持久化任务事实，供重启后恢复与查询 | 最终事实的唯一存储 |\\n\\n## 任务拆分（按依赖顺序）\\n\\n### 阶段 A：数据与状态基础（无依赖，先行）\\n\\n- **A1. 数据库表与仓储**\\n  - 说明：新增 `import_tasks` 表（id、类型、状态、总行数、完成行数、错误信息、最终结果、创建/更新时间）。状态机：`pending → running → succeeded | failed | canceled`。\\n  - 职责归属：Product Owner + 数据库。\\n  - 验证：单测覆盖状态迁移与持久化读写；重启后数据仍在。\\n\\n- **A2. 任务状态机与取消幂等语义**\\n  - 说明：定义 `cancel` 处理规则——任务已是终态（succeeded/failed/canceled）时重复取消直接返回成功，不产生副作用；运行中取消标记为 canceled 并触发中断。\\n  - 职责归属：Product Owner。\\n  - 验证：单测覆盖“取消已终态任务”“取消运行中任务”“并发重复取消”三种场景。\\n\\n### 阶段 B：主进程执行与事件（依赖 A1）\\n\\n- **B1. 导入执行器（Main Host）**\\n  - 说明：执行导入逻辑，接收取消信号，周期性把瞬时进度通过 Runtime Event 发出；结束时只把最终事实写入 Product Owner。\\n  - 职责归属：Main Host（执行）、Product Owner（落最终状态）。\\n  - 验证：集成测试确认事件流只含瞬时进度、终态只来自数据库；取消信号能中断执行。\\n\\n- **B2. 进度事件通道（Runtime Event）**\\n  - 说明：定义瞬时进度事件结构（taskId、percent、processedRows），仅供 UI 展示，无持久化路径。\\n  - 职责归属：Main Host → Renderer。\\n  - 验证：测试确认事件不含且不更新任何最终业务状态字段。\\n\\n### 阶段 C：IPC 契约与界面（依赖 B1、B2）\\n\\n- **C1. IPC Contract 实现**\\n  - 说明：实现 `start-import`、`get-task`、`list-tasks`、`cancel-task` 通道；Renderer 仅经由此层访问。\\n  - 职责归属：Main Host 与 Renderer 共同遵守契约。\\n  - 验证：契约测试确认请求/响应结构与文档一致；渲染层无直接状态访问。\\n\\n- **C2. UI 交互**\\n  - 说明：发起导入按钮、进度展示（订阅 Runtime Event 刷新）、取消按钮、任务列表与重启后的结果展示。\\n  - 职责归属：Renderer。\\n  - 验证：手工/UI 测试覆盖发起、进度更新、取消、重启后查看结果。\\n\\n### 阶段 D：恢复与容错（依赖 A1、B1）\\n\\n- **D1. 启动恢复**\\n  - 说明：应用启动时由 Product Owner 读取未完成/已完成任务，恢复中断的 running 任务或将其标记为 failed（可配置策略），保证失败不阻止应用启动。\\n  - 职责归属：Main Host + Product Owner。\\n  - 验证：模拟崩溃后重启，应用正常启动且任务状态符合预期。\\n\\n- **D2. 端到端验收**\\n  - 说明：按 feature-brief 场景走完整链路：发起 → 进度 → 取消 → 重启 → 查看结果。\\n  - 职责归属：全部模块联调。\\n  - 验证：端到端测试通过；确认 Runtime Event 未成为任何最终状态；取消幂等；启动不被失败阻断；无云同步；本阶段不涉及打包验证。\\n\\n## 依赖关系图\\n\\n```\\nA1 ──> A2 ──> B1 ──> C1 ──> C2\\n  \\\\        \\\\      └─> D1 ──> D2\\n   └────────┘\\n```\\n\\n- A1、A2 无前置依赖，可并行。\\n- B1、B2 依赖 A1（A2 的幂等语义为 B1 的取消提供前提，实际依赖 A1+A2）。\\n- C1 依赖 B1、B2；C2 依赖 C1。\\n- D1 依赖 A1、B1；D2 为最终联调。\\n\\n## 每项任务的验证方式\\n\\n| 任务 | 验证方式 |\\n|---|---|\\n| A1 | 单元测试（状态迁移、持久化、重启后数据仍在） |\\n| A2 | 单元测试（终态重复取消、运行中取消、并发取消） |\\n| B1 | 集成测试（事件仅瞬时进度、终态仅来自数据库、取消可中断） |\\n| B2 | 集成测试（事件不写最终状态） |\\n| C1 | 契约测试（通道与结构一致、渲染层无直接访问） |\\n| C2 | UI 测试（发起/进度/取消/重启后查看） |\\n| D1 | 崩溃恢复测试（重启正常启动、任务状态正确） |\\n| D2 | 端到端验收（完整场景通过） |\\n\"}","name":"write_file"},"id":"call_00_i9T1sGjveZIdGMKW0St19575","type":"function"}]},{"content":"{\n  \"path\": \"delivery/implementation-plan.md\",\n  \"bytesWritten\": 5252,\n  \"created\": true,\n  \"overwritten\": false,\n  \"fingerprint\": \"2d48f2b3e5ff86834985d55f8402c5cf37092b853d93ddf51cc6626011dc34a1\"\n}","role":"tool","tool_call_id":"call_00_i9T1sGjveZIdGMKW0St19575"},{"content":null,"reasoning_content":"","role":"assistant","tool_calls":[{"function":{"arguments":"{\"content\":\"# 可恢复后台导入任务 — 风险清单\\n\\n依据：`project/feature-brief.md`、`project/architecture.md`、`project/constraints.md`\\n\\n| 风险 | 影响 | 缓解 | 验证方式 |\\n|---|---|---|---|\\n| Runtime Event 被当作最终业务状态（如进度落库、UI 直接写状态） | 违反架构约束；重启后结果不可信 | 明确事件仅含瞬时字段（percent、processedRows）；最终事实一律经 Product Owner 写库 | 代码审查 + B2 集成测试断言事件不更新任何最终状态字段 |\\n| 取消非幂等（重复取消报错或产生副作用） | 用户操作失败、状态错乱 | 状态机在终态直接返回成功；取消处理加锁/原子状态迁移 | A2 单元测试覆盖终态重复取消、运行中取消、并发取消 |\\n| 崩溃/重启后任务状态丢失或恢复失败 | 用户无法查看最终结果，违背核心目标 | 任务事实持久化到数据库；启动时由 Product Owner 恢复并重调度中断任务 | A1 持久化单测 + D1 崩溃恢复测试（模拟崩溃后重启） |\\n| 失败任务阻断应用启动 | 应用不可用 | 启动恢复逻辑捕获所有任务异常，失败任务标记为 failed 而非抛错阻塞 | D1 测试：注入失败任务后应用仍正常启动 |\\n| 进度推送过频导致 UI 卡顿或主进程负担 | 性能问题、体验下降 | 节流/合并瞬时进度事件；事件仅用于展示 | B1 集成测试 + 性能冒烟检查 |\\n| 取消后任务仍在后台写库（竞态） | 状态不一致，终态被覆盖 | 执行器先检查取消标志再落终态；终态写入为原子操作 | B1 集成测试覆盖取消竞态场景 |\\n| Renderer 绕过 IPC Contract 直接访问状态 | 分层架构被破坏，难以维护 | 契约测试强制渲染层只经 IPC；代码审查把关 | C1 契约测试断言渲染层仅依赖 IPC 通道 |\\n| 恢复策略歧义（running 任务恢复重跑 vs 标记失败） | 行为不一致、数据重复导入 | 明确并文档化恢复策略（本次采用可配置策略，默认标记 failed） | D1 测试按文档化策略断言 |\\n| 任务结果超过存储限制或含敏感数据 | 存储膨胀、安全问题 | 结果字段限长/裁剪；敏感信息脱敏后入库 | 代码审查 + A1 仓储测试 |\\n| 范围蔓延（云同步、打包等非本次范围） | 交付延期 | 以 constraints.md 为准，验收不包含打包，不实现云同步 | D2 端到端验收清单核对范围 |\\n\",\"path\":\"delivery/risk-checklist.md\"}","name":"write_file"},"id":"call_00_ET_YoGuvOzmfqfYJET3BIP68961","type":"function"}]},{"content":"{\n  \"path\": \"delivery/risk-checklist.md\",\n  \"bytesWritten\": 2442,\n  \"created\": true,\n  \"overwritten\": false,\n  \"fingerprint\": \"0d58ab7952e79cfd5a4c1432a28bed679636e29f8a2bdec1ec0ee4018ec768e8\"\n}","role":"tool","tool_call_id":"call_00_ET_YoGuvOzmfqfYJET3BIP68961"},{"content":null,"reasoning_content":"","role":"assistant","tool_calls":[{"function":{"arguments":"{\"path\":\"delivery\"}","name":"list_directory"},"id":"call_00_dnV8gI2SdXRjbQ6qttqK4859","type":"function"}]},{"content":"{\n  \"path\": \"delivery\",\n  \"entries\": [\n    {\n      \"name\": \"implementation-plan.md\",\n      \"kind\": \"file\",\n      \"path\": \"delivery/implementation-plan.md\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"name\": \"risk-checklist.md\",\n      \"kind\": \"file\",\n      \"path\": \"delivery/risk-checklist.md\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"offset\": 0,\n  \"hasMore\": false\n}","role":"tool","tool_call_id":"call_00_dnV8gI2SdXRjbQ6qttqK4859"},{"content":"已完成。已读取三份项目文档并创建两份交付文档。\n\n**产出**\n- `delivery/implementation-plan.md` — 实施计划\n- `delivery/risk-checklist.md` — 风险清单\n\n**实施计划要点**\n- 分层职责表：Renderer 只走 IPC Contract；Main Host 负责进程能力；Product Owner 保存业务状态；Runtime Event 仅传瞬时进度；数据库保存最终事实。\n- 按依赖顺序拆分 8 个任务（A1 数据库与状态机 → A2 取消幂等 → B1 执行器 / B2 事件通道 → C1 IPC 契约 / C2 UI → D1 启动恢复 → D2 端到端验收），含依赖关系图和每项任务的验证方式。\n\n**风险清单要点**\n- 10 项风险，每项含影响、缓解、验证方式，重点覆盖约束中强调的：Runtime Event 不得成为最终状态、取消幂等、失败不阻断启动、不实现云同步、验证不含打包。\n\n两份文件均已写入 `delivery/` 目录并确认存在。","reasoning_content":"","role":"assistant"},{"content":[{"text":"现在再读取 project/review-notes.md，复审你刚才创建的两个文件。发现遗漏或矛盾就直接修订原文件，并在最终回复中说明修订了哪些问题。不要新建第三份交付文档。","type":"text"}],"role":"user"},{"content":null,"reasoning_content":"","role":"assistant","tool_calls":[{"function":{"arguments":"{\"path\":\"project/review-notes.md\"}","name":"read_file"},"id":"call_00_ET_beZmCHTfdsDjrGqS8LFh1573","type":"function"}]},{"content":"{\n  \"path\": \"project/review-notes.md\",\n  \"content\": \"# 复审重点\\n\\n检查计划是否误把瞬时事件当持久状态；是否遗漏重启恢复和幂等取消；风险清单必须为每个高风险项给出验证方式。\\n\",\n  \"offset\": 0,\n  \"bytesReturned\": 173,\n  \"sizeBytes\": 173,\n  \"hasMore\": false\n}","role":"tool","tool_call_id":"call_00_ET_beZmCHTfdsDjrGqS8LFh1573"},{"content":"已读取 `project/review-notes.md`。复审要点：①瞬时事件不得被当持久状态；②不得遗漏重启恢复与幂等取消；③风险清单每个高风险项必须有验证方式。\n\n对照检查后发现以下问题，直接修订原文件：","reasoning_content":"","role":"assistant","tool_calls":[{"function":{"arguments":"{\"path\":\"delivery/implementation-plan.md\",\"edits\":[{\"oldText\":\"- **A1. 数据库表与仓储**\\n  - 说明：新增 `import_tasks` 表（id、类型、状态、总行数、完成行数、错误信息、最终结果、创建/更新时间）。状态机：`pending → running → succeeded | failed | canceled`。\\n  - 职责归属：Product Owner + 数据库。\\n  - 验证：单测覆盖状态迁移与持久化读写；重启后数据仍在。\",\"newText\":\"- **A1. 数据库表与仓储**\\n  - 说明：新增 `import_tasks` 表（id、类型、状态、总行数、完成行数、错误信息、最终结果、创建/更新时间）。状态机：`pending → running → succeeded | failed | canceled`。该表只保存任务最终事实：执行期间的瞬时进度（百分比、当前行数等）一律不写库，仅经 Runtime Event 传递；完成行数等数值只在任务到达终态时一次性写入。\\n  - 职责归属：Product Owner + 数据库。\\n  - 验证：单测覆盖表结构与持久化读写（含重启后数据仍在）；确认执行期间无进度写库路径。\"},{\"oldText\":\"  - 验证：单测覆盖“取消已终态任务”“取消运行中任务”“并发重复取消”三种场景。\",\"newText\":\"  - 验证：单测覆盖状态机全量迁移（pending → running → succeeded | failed | canceled），以及“取消已终态任务”“取消运行中任务”“并发重复取消”三种场景。\"},{\"oldText\":\"```\\nA1 ──> A2 ──> B1 ──> C1 ──> C2\\n  \\\\        \\\\      └─> D1 ──> D2\\n   └────────┘\\n```\\n\\n- A1、A2 无前置依赖，可并行。\\n- B1、B2 依赖 A1（A2 的幂等语义为 B1 的取消提供前提，实际依赖 A1+A2）。\\n- C1 依赖 B1、B2；C2 依赖 C1。\\n- D1 依赖 A1、B1；D2 为最终联调。\",\"newText\":\"```\\nA1 ──┬──> B1 ──> C1 ──> C2\\nA2 ──┘   │\\n         └──> D1 ──> D2\\n```\\n\\n- A1、A2 无前置依赖，可并行。\\n- B1 依赖 A1（执行落库）与 A2（取消依赖幂等语义）；B2 仅定义事件结构、无数据依赖，但事件由执行器发出，其集成验证依赖 B1。\\n- C1 依赖 B1、B2；C2 依赖 C1。\\n- D1 依赖 A1（直接读取任务事实）与 B1（恢复调度，经 B1 传递 A1/A2 依赖）；D2 为最终联调。\"}]}","name":"edit_file"},"id":"call_00_DMNkkpTSLEdARJ3IEIrz3345","type":"function"}]},{"content":"{\n  \"path\": \"delivery/implementation-plan.md\",\n  \"replacements\": 3,\n  \"changed\": true,\n  \"fingerprint\": \"ce6f761d70127e3f1dee04db9c0b1f925aeb04cb25abe71a7f3e0178f8f58850\"\n}","role":"tool","tool_call_id":"call_00_DMNkkpTSLEdARJ3IEIrz3345"}],"model":"deepseek-v4-flash","reasoning_effort":"high","stream":true,"stream_options":{"include_usage":true},"thinking":{"type":"enabled"},"tools":[{"function":{"description":"Read a bounded UTF-8 text page from a text, Markdown, DOCX, or PDF file. Pages are limited to 12,000 bytes by default; when hasMore is true, continue with nextOffset to read the remaining pages. Use limit to request a smaller page, offset to resume from a byte offset.","name":"read_file","parameters":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"limit":{"description":"Maximum UTF-8 content bytes requested for this page.","minimum":1,"type":"integer"},"offset":{"description":"UTF-8 byte offset. Defaults to 0.","minimum":0,"type":"integer"},"path":{"description":"The file to read. Relative paths are resolved from the current working directory.","type":"string"}},"required":["path"],"type":"object"},"strict":false},"type":"function"},{"function":{"description":"List files and directories. Returns up to 100 entries per page by default; when hasMore is true, continue with nextOffset. Use limit, offset, maxDepth, and includeHidden to control the traversal.","name":"list_directory","parameters":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"includeHidden":{"description":"Whether hidden files should be included.","type":"boolean"},"limit":{"description":"Optional maximum number of entries.","type":"integer"},"maxDepth":{"description":"Optional recursive depth limit.","type":"integer"},"offset":{"description":"Entry offset. Defaults to 0.","minimum":0,"type":"integer"},"path":{"description":"The directory to list. Relative paths are resolved from the current working directory.","type":"string"}},"required":["path"],"type":"object"},"strict":false},"type":"function"},{"function":{"description":"Find files matching a glob pattern without reading file content. Returns up to 500 matches per page by default; when hasMore is true, continue with nextOffset.","name":"glob","parameters":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"cwd":{"description":"The directory to search from. Relative paths are resolved from the current working directory.","type":"string"},"includeHidden":{"description":"Whether hidden files should be included.","type":"boolean"},"limit":{"description":"Optional maximum number of matches.","type":"integer"},"offset":{"description":"Match offset. Defaults to 0.","minimum":0,"type":"integer"},"pattern":{"description":"Glob pattern using *, **, ?, or character sets.","type":"string"}},"required":["pattern"],"type":"object"},"strict":false},"type":"function"},{"function":{"description":"Search text in readable files, including Markdown, DOCX, and PDF. Returns up to 100 matches per page by default, with file path, line, and preview; when hasMore is true, continue with nextOffset.","name":"search_text","parameters":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"caseSensitive":{"description":"Whether matching is case-sensitive.","type":"boolean"},"limit":{"description":"Optional maximum number of matches.","type":"integer"},"offset":{"description":"Match offset. Defaults to 0.","minimum":0,"type":"integer"},"path":{"description":"The path to search in. Relative paths are resolved from the current working directory.","type":"string"},"query":{"description":"Literal text to search for.","type":"string"}},"required":["query"],"type":"object"},"strict":false},"type":"function"},{"function":{"description":"Apply ordered exact-text edits to an existing UTF-8 text file. Each edit must match unique text exactly.","name":"edit_file","parameters":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"edits":{"items":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"newText":{"type":"string"},"oldText":{"minLength":1,"type":"string"}},"required":["oldText","newText"],"type":"object"},"type":"array"},"expectedFingerprint":{"description":"Optional fingerprint returned by read_file.","type":"string"},"path":{"description":"File path.","type":"string"}},"required":["path","edits"],"type":"object"},"strict":false},"type":"function"},{"function":{"description":"Create or overwrite a UTF-8 text file with provided text content. Structured PDF and DOCX writing is not supported.","name":"write_file","parameters":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"content":{"description":"Text content to write.","type":"string"},"overwrite":{"description":"Whether an existing file may be overwritten.","type":"boolean"},"path":{"description":"The file to write. Relative paths are resolved from the current working directory.","type":"string"}},"required":["path","content"],"type":"object"},"strict":false},"type":"function"},{"function":{"description":"Create a directory.","name":"create_directory","parameters":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"path":{"description":"Directory path.","type":"string"},"recursive":{"description":"Create missing parent directories.","type":"boolean"}},"required":["path"],"type":"object"},"strict":false},"type":"function"},{"function":{"description":"Copy a file or directory.","name":"copy_path","parameters":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"destination":{"description":"Destination path.","type":"string"},"overwrite":{"description":"Replace an existing destination.","type":"boolean"},"source":{"description":"Source path.","type":"string"}},"required":["source","destination"],"type":"object"},"strict":false},"type":"function"},{"function":{"description":"Move or rename a file or directory.","name":"move_path","parameters":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"destination":{"description":"Destination path.","type":"string"},"overwrite":{"description":"Replace an existing destination.","type":"boolean"},"source":{"description":"Source path.","type":"string"}},"required":["source","destination"],"type":"object"},"strict":false},"type":"function"},{"function":{"description":"Move a file or directory to a recoverable Workspace location. Deleted paths can be restored.","name":"delete_path","parameters":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"path":{"description":"Path to delete.","type":"string"},"recursive":{"description":"Allow a non-empty directory.","type":"boolean"}},"required":["path"],"type":"object"},"strict":false},"type":"function"},{"function":{"description":"Run a command and return output previews. Captures up to 20,000 bytes per stream (stdout and stderr).","name":"run_command","parameters":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"command":{"description":"A command written for Windows PowerShell.","type":"string"},"cwd":{"description":"The working directory for the command. Relative paths are resolved from the current working directory.","type":"string"},"timeoutMs":{"description":"Optional timeout in milliseconds.","type":"integer"}},"required":["command"],"type":"object"},"strict":false},"type":"function"},{"function":{"description":"Search the web and return structured result summaries and URLs. Returns up to 5 results by default (maximum 20).","name":"web_search","parameters":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"count":{"description":"Optional number of search results. Defaults to 5.","maximum":20,"minimum":1,"type":"integer"},"query":{"description":"Search query. Use a focused query containing the important names and constraints.","maxLength":400,"minLength":1,"type":"string"}},"required":["query"],"type":"object"},"strict":false},"type":"function"},{"function":{"description":"Read an HTTP(S) page and return size-limited text content (up to 9,000 bytes).","name":"web_fetch","parameters":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"url":{"description":"HTTP(S) URL to read.","minLength":1,"type":"string"}},"required":["url"],"type":"object"},"strict":false},"type":"function"},{"function":{"description":"Update the current task plan with a complete ordered snapshot of its steps and statuses. Each update replaces the entire plan.","name":"update_plan","parameters":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"explanation":{"description":"Optional reason for this plan update.","type":"string"},"plan":{"items":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"status":{"enum":["pending","in_progress","completed"],"type":"string"},"step":{"type":"string"}},"required":["step","status"],"type":"object"},"type":"array"}},"required":["plan"],"type":"object"},"strict":false},"type":"function"}]}